      "message": "I think the issue this CL attempts to address is:\n1. Someone calls start_scan which leaves a task in the background\n1. BT stack is shut down\n1. The background task keeps interacting with btif and causes crashes\n\nIf I understand correctly this patch actually adds a gate to step 1 but GATT is disable at step 2, so it doesn\u0027t really guard the problematic request.\n\nA proper fix shall probably be in one of the directions:\n1. Check whether the adapter is off INSIDE the async task\n1. Block the shutdown procedure until there is no background task\n\nI think 1 is the easier solution; We may even perform the check in topshim and prevent this kind of issues at once.",
